{"id":"mstmtserver.1","n":"mstmtserver","s":"1","src":{"r":{"pkg":"mstflint","ver":"4.30.0-1.el9","repo":"AppStream","url":"https://dl.rockylinux.org/vault/rocky/9.6/AppStream/x86_64/os/Packages/m/mstflint-4.30.0-1.el9.x86_64.rpm","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/mstmtserver.1.gz","sha256":"5d0163796455640b6da48cf7c3c84807b798f1afb484d2e0db11879bac5239a0","date":"March 2020","origin":"mstflint"}},"nopt":{"r":0},"desc":"mstflint mst mt server","r":[["NAME","<p>mstmtserver - mstflint mst mt server</p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p>Usage:</p> <dl><dt></dt><dd>mstmtserver [switches]</dd></dl>  <h3>Switches may be:</h3> <p><b>-p[ort]</b> &lt;port&gt; - Listen to specify port (default is 23108).</p> <p><b>-d[ebug]</b> - Print all socket traffic (for debugging only).</p> <p><b>-h[elp]</b> - Print help message.</p> <p><b>-v[ersion]</b> - Print version.</p>"],["SEE ALSO","<p><b>mstflint(1)</b></p>"]]}